# Pueblo Bruma (C4a, contract 39), 30 x 24. column = i, row = j. Ruta 10 arrives at the NORTH edge (i = 13..14, j = 0), Ruta 8 leaves by the WEST edge (i = 0, rows 12..13). Look (the user's mock
# "Pueblo Bruma": BIG worn flagstones, 2 x 2 per slab: the four quarter tiles oflag_<i%2><j%2>, never small cobbles): an old misty town, low dry-stone walls with dark pines behind, animated street lamps, benches and
# flowerbeds, a memorial garden of steles in front of the TORRE DE LOS RECUERDOS (the tower: open in C4b, its door is the cell (25,3); a medium beside the door warns about the ghosts).
# C5a (contract 47): a SOUTH gate (i = 12..13, j = 23) leads to Ruta 12 (the fishing pier; spawn `south` (12,22)).
# Centro (door c), tienda (door k) and the old man's house (door h: he is NOT home, he is in the tower; his granddaughter says so).
@map pueblo_bruma
@size 30 24
@interior no
@area pueblo_bruma
@fly 5 pueblo_bruma 5 5 face=S   # the Planeador lands here, in front of the Centro door; slot 5 = visited flag 989 (contract 46.1)
@bg 0
@fog yes
@fill oflag_00
@spawn north 13 1 S
@spawn west 1 12 E
@spawn centro_door 5 5 S
@spawn tienda_door 11 5 S
@spawn casa_door 19 5 S
@spawn torre_door 25 4 S
@spawn south 12 22 N
